<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC to meet next June 25 - Algeria.</title>
<headline>OPEC to meet next June 25 - Algeria.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian oil minister Amar Makhloufi said OPEC's next full meeting would be on June 25 next year.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
